      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Viego's spectral blade passively deals bonus percent current Health damage On-Hit and strikes twice vs. enemies he recently hit with an Ability, stealing Health. Viego can activate this Ability to thrust his zweihander forward, impaling enemies in front of him.",
      "summary_zh": "佛耶戈的鬼魅之刃会在被动地在命中时造成额外的百分比当前生命值伤害攻击特效，并对近期被他用一个技能袭击过的敌人进行两次打击，同时窃取生命值。 佛耶戈可以激活这个技能来向前刺出他的双手巨剑，穿刺他前方的所有敌人们。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1482652:4009446"
      ]
    },
